{"posts":[{"id":"dbrrbd_p52_1276","t":"Hi Victoryong,\n\nThank you for this. I was looking at a few different ways to do this and your rules look great. I have attached 8 examples. If you get a chance can you tell me what you think.\n\nThank you very much for your time.","a":"Tirnanog","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1276","p":52,"im":["a722e5430286f862623b105a2a503004d11758cf"],"fa":"سلام Victoryong،\n\nممنون از این. داشتم چند روش مختلف برای انجام این کار رو بررسی می‌کردم و قواعد تو عالی به نظر می‌رسن. 8 نمونه پیوست کردم. اگه فرصتی داشتی، می‌تونی بگی نظرت چیه.\n\nخیلی ممنون از وقتی که می‌ذاری.","m":1276},{"id":"dbrrbd_p52_1277","t":"If anyone gets a chance could you tell me if the attached would be considered a Valid setup? mohsin360 and victoryong, Thank you for helping me. The process is captivating.","a":"Tirnanog","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1277","p":52,"im":["a0078e32b112c17fd5fd2303222cf4d9010d7616"],"fa":"اگه کسی فرصت داشت، می‌شه بگید آیا چیزی که پیوست کردم یک ستاپ معتبر حساب می‌شه؟ mohsin360 و victoryong، ممنون که کمکم می‌کنید. این روند واقعاً جذابه.","m":1277},{"id":"dbrrbd_p52_1278","t":"Hi Tirnanog, Your zone drawing is good to me, here are variation. Giving you options to choose from.\n\nCheers\n\nTirnanog wrote: Hi Victoryong,\n\nThank you for this. I was looking at a few different ways to do this and your rules look great. I have attached 8 examples. If you get a chance can you tell me what you think.\n\nThank you very much for your time.","a":"victoryong","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1278","p":52,"im":["a16354f09480b88821becfb7b40993842f90495d"],"fa":"سلام Tirnanog، رسم ناحیه‌هات به نظر من خوبه، این هم یک حالت دیگه. چند گزینه می‌ذارم جلوت که انتخاب کنی.\n\nموفق باشی\n\nTirnanog نوشت: سلام Victoryong،\n\nممنون از این. داشتم چند روش مختلف برای انجام این کار رو بررسی می‌کردم و قواعد تو عالی به نظر می‌رسن. 8 نمونه پیوست کردم. اگه فرصتی داشتی، می‌تونی بگی نظرت چیه.\n\nخیلی ممنون از وقتی که می‌ذاری.","ib":{"a16354f09480b88821becfb7b40993842f90495d":2},"m":1278},{"id":"dbrrbd_p52_1279","t":"Thanks. I plan to get some practice in over the weekend, I'll try a lot of each to see what fits. Thanks again. I hope you have a great weekend.","a":"Tirnanog","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1279","p":52,"im":[],"fa":"ممنون. قصد دارم آخر هفته یه‌کم تمرین کنم، از هر کدوم زیاد امتحان می‌کنم ببینم کدوم جواب می‌ده. باز هم ممنون. امیدوارم آخر هفتهٔ خوبی داشته باشی.","m":1279},{"id":"dbrrbd_p52_1280","t":"Just some more practice.","a":"Tirnanog","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1280","p":52,"im":["4a3ed36a019b9147fbc6711d04027a6feed235cc","56a3e2dcd9ad3e2af19965377fcab9c379d39946","a56fbad0cbbb40d2316f5e5daa0d7556faf1574e"],"fa":"فقط یه‌کم تمرین بیشتر.","ib":{"4a3ed36a019b9147fbc6711d04027a6feed235cc":1,"56a3e2dcd9ad3e2af19965377fcab9c379d39946":1,"a56fbad0cbbb40d2316f5e5daa0d7556faf1574e":1},"m":1280},{"id":"dbrrbd_p52_1281","t":"RBD Home","a":"AlvaroA26","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1281","p":52,"im":["82876f46c758bd9952ccac24bf53f6f6134cbf85"],"fa":"RBD — خانه","ib":{"82876f46c758bd9952ccac24bf53f6f6134cbf85":1},"m":1281},{"id":"dbrrbd_p52_1282","t":"I'm going to keep an eye on Gbp/Cad D1 looks like it will be coming up area of supply and make a nice drop. I found a few areas of DBD, RBD, etc. I'm sure there is more that I missed.","a":"AlvaroA26","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1282","p":52,"im":["66916ebf7836f65b92f3d218907465907fef6030"],"fa":"می‌خوام Gbp/Cad رو زیر نظر بگیرم. D1 به نظر می‌رسه داره به ناحیهٔ عرضه می‌رسه و یه ریزش خوب بکنه. چند ناحیهٔ DBD، RBD و از این چیزها پیدا کردم. مطمئنم بیشتر از این‌ها هست که از دستم در رفته.","ib":{"66916ebf7836f65b92f3d218907465907fef6030":1},"m":1282},{"id":"dbrrbd_p52_1283","t":"Just looking for DBR and RBD. I have tried to take the extreme turning points, I'm not too sure if the levels in between at classified as RBR, DBD's","a":"cedge","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1283","p":52,"im":["cc3c7708222b69e83198d79f39e7bf38b919fcb6"],"fa":"فقط دنبال DBR و RBD می‌گردم. سعی کردم نقاط چرخش اکستریم رو بگیرم، ولی مطمئن نیستم سطوح وسطی رو می‌شه RBR یا DBD حساب کرد یا نه.","ib":{"cc3c7708222b69e83198d79f39e7bf38b919fcb6":1},"m":1283},{"id":"dbrrbd_p52_1284","t":"My goal is to find clear and reactive areas. Checks are rejections, \"x\"s are engulfs.","a":"karlo","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1284","p":52,"im":["d896a2f83237b06de96c54bd12f5480bcdd13254"],"fa":"هدفم پیدا کردن ناحیه‌های شفاف و واکنش‌داره. تیک‌ها نشانهٔ ريجکشن‌اند، «x»ها اینگالف‌اند.","ib":{"d896a2f83237b06de96c54bd12f5480bcdd13254":1},"m":1284},{"id":"dbrrbd_p52_1285","t":"","a":"karlo","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1285","p":52,"im":["fbf76bafd9b37f9ed707b3984ecaea8bce85f52e"],"ib":{"fbf76bafd9b37f9ed707b3984ecaea8bce85f52e":0},"m":1285},{"id":"dbrrbd_p52_1286","t":"I look for decisions to engulf something important and then watch what happens when price comes back to these DPs.","a":"karlo","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1286","p":52,"im":["937ffe199de466b8d003842d44ffc8df1a26f61c"],"fa":"دنبال این می‌گردم که کندل‌های تصمیم چیزی مهم رو اینگالف کنن و بعد می‌بینم وقتی قیمت به این DP‌ها برمی‌گرده چه اتفاقی می‌افته.","ib":{"937ffe199de466b8d003842d44ffc8df1a26f61c":1},"m":1286},{"id":"dbrrbd_p52_1287","t":"","a":"karlo","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1287","p":52,"im":["43bd1697525bf866cef79cdf1ed9cf4da2a14a4a"],"ib":{"43bd1697525bf866cef79cdf1ed9cf4da2a14a4a":0},"m":1287},{"id":"dbrrbd_p52_1288","t":"","a":"karlo","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1288","p":52,"im":["e4dd29550a9c84e177fe608d2345740f237c3abd"],"ib":{"e4dd29550a9c84e177fe608d2345740f237c3abd":0},"m":1288},{"id":"dbrrbd_p52_1289","t":"I think filled rectangles are less confusing.","a":"karlo","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1289","p":52,"im":["152929f1be30768a5a30986b0b62849e58c18436"],"fa":"به نظرم مستطیل‌های توپر گیج‌کنندگی کمتری دارن.","ib":{"152929f1be30768a5a30986b0b62849e58c18436":1},"m":1289},{"id":"dbrrbd_p52_1290","t":"","a":"karlo","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1290","p":52,"im":["a872f6032cf7ef9d95a07725971d79a7b7daa39c"],"ib":{"a872f6032cf7ef9d95a07725971d79a7b7daa39c":0},"m":1290},{"id":"dbrrbd_p52_1291","t":"Ifmyante wrote: This is quite a bit better.\n\nDid you notice how if one is ignored, it can stop price from coming back through again?\n\nHi MR IF Please answer this quastion! tnx sir.","a":"ofshen","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1291","p":52,"im":[],"fa":"Ifmyante نوشت: این خیلی بهتر است.\n\nدقت کردی اگر یکی نادیده گرفته شود، می‌تواند جلوی برگشت دوبارهٔ قیمت را بگیرد؟\n\nسلام آقای IF، لطفاً به این سؤال جواب بدید! ممنون قربان.","m":1291},{"id":"dbrrbd_p52_1292","t":"Ok, I started doing my homework. This is a first set of my HW. I focused on FTB and marked the reaction. Comments are welcome.\n\nNOTE: I do not marked every RBD, DBR, RBR or DBD because the chart would be very messy.","a":"deenius","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1292","p":52,"im":["7de698838b2acf56c461d9f49757a9ecbc4462dd","ec6f1f2f55ddda3077177baa78ff59376efa16c1","4b141c03df27b7640521d27112c7dd529619a765","157d3c3dfabceabba92b3ed99681843cd6405f29","85c103694ac279021703e65946e42cff6b443153"],"fa":"باشه، شروع کردم به انجام تکلیفم. این اولین دسته از تکلیفمه. روی FTB تمرکز کردم و واکنش رو علامت زدم. نظرها رو بگید، خوشحال می‌شم.\n\nتوجه: همهٔ RBD، DBR، RBR یا DBD رو علامت نزدم، چون چارت خیلی شلوغ می‌شد.","ib":{"7de698838b2acf56c461d9f49757a9ecbc4462dd":2,"ec6f1f2f55ddda3077177baa78ff59376efa16c1":2,"4b141c03df27b7640521d27112c7dd529619a765":2,"157d3c3dfabceabba92b3ed99681843cd6405f29":2,"85c103694ac279021703e65946e42cff6b443153":2},"m":1292},{"id":"dbrrbd_p52_1293","t":"Set number 2. Feel free to comment","a":"deenius","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1293","p":52,"im":["755803f042c76ce2b562b7935e48fb587a4c1dae","6d447b45d09d615ca64c8079c0ed3dbb9073b598","b83419e09f4723fbc1028c3e6adc9db9edc44bfd","3fcadcc42bbd63522135533b7b139c425ff37fdf","ea95c4820579b1b724f23a0ff91f08dbf85ce55e"],"fa":"دستهٔ شمارهٔ 2. راحت نظر بدید","ib":{"755803f042c76ce2b562b7935e48fb587a4c1dae":1,"6d447b45d09d615ca64c8079c0ed3dbb9073b598":1,"b83419e09f4723fbc1028c3e6adc9db9edc44bfd":1,"3fcadcc42bbd63522135533b7b139c425ff37fdf":1,"ea95c4820579b1b724f23a0ff91f08dbf85ce55e":1},"m":1293},{"id":"dbrrbd_p52_1294","t":"Set number 3. This is end for today","a":"deenius","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1294","p":52,"im":["6fa677727e9add9b6a251580b5132807a8ecda22","793b52a0eaf145159d62fb42ae1ca95ed3b933f0","22ca9a22d632c8414c675a132995435b2871a58b","356b40163a86c4e6b8ae3ba642380e58ca28e300","3703b9135394e9f7fd39aaf1fe09aa159377b7df"],"fa":"دستهٔ شمارهٔ 3. برای امروز تمومه","ib":{"6fa677727e9add9b6a251580b5132807a8ecda22":1,"793b52a0eaf145159d62fb42ae1ca95ed3b933f0":1,"22ca9a22d632c8414c675a132995435b2871a58b":1,"356b40163a86c4e6b8ae3ba642380e58ca28e300":1,"3703b9135394e9f7fd39aaf1fe09aa159377b7df":1},"m":1294},{"id":"dbrrbd_p52_1295","t":"Last set of charts. Could someone tell me if I'm doing my S/D levels in correct way? Thank you!","a":"deenius","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1295","p":52,"im":["af18ef6d22ad4a8741a960d80b7537bb195374ef","802848734fc9c7f0d1b2120df3ef3f8f1ba1eb43","cc2e5a80bfb94bcc9b487b6661ddffe09e60664e","a5de4569bd05463d8b163008b4b33e2acdd081c6","2025301743c2a999c758c95ed3b45a0ae7d692e1"],"fa":"آخرین دسته چارت‌ها. می‌شه یکی بگه آیا سطوح S/D رو درست کار می‌کنم؟ ممنون!","ib":{"af18ef6d22ad4a8741a960d80b7537bb195374ef":1,"802848734fc9c7f0d1b2120df3ef3f8f1ba1eb43":1,"cc2e5a80bfb94bcc9b487b6661ddffe09e60664e":1,"a5de4569bd05463d8b163008b4b33e2acdd081c6":1,"2025301743c2a999c758c95ed3b45a0ae7d692e1":1},"m":1295},{"id":"dbrrbd_p52_1296","t":"Hi Deenius,\n\nYes you are. However try to incorporate the sequences of h-l-hh-hl-hh-ll-lh-ll or (hh-hl-lh-ll) etc... even if it's only in your minds eye. Now go back over the charts you posted and look at the X areas. You will find that often a good demand for instance is one that is a higher low that either made a hh or is part of the base where the downtrend sequence shifted giving you the lowest low that is also often a qm zone.\n\nHope this helps,","a":"pucci","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1296","p":52,"im":[],"fa":"سلام Deenius،\n\nبله، درست انجام می‌دی. ولی سعی کن توالی‌های h-l-hh-hl-hh-ll-lh-ll یا (hh-hl-lh-ll) و از این قبیل رو هم در نظر بگیری… حتی اگه فقط توی ذهنت باشه. حالا برگرد و چارت‌هایی که گذاشتی رو نگاه کن و ناحیه‌های X رو ببین. می‌بینی که مثلاً یک تقاضای خوب اغلب همان کف بالاتری است که یا یک hh ساخته یا بخشی از بیسی است که در آن توالی نزولی تغییر کرده و کف پایین‌تر را داده، که آن هم غالباً یک ناحیهٔ QM است.\n\nامیدوارم کمک کرده باشه،","m":1296},{"id":"dbrrbd_p52_1297","t":"Hi Pucci. Sorry for the stupid question...But WHEN do you consider an important DBR RBD no more important.?? In other words, you look for an engulf, consumption,spiked. Or shall we consider an important RBD DBR ALWAYS important?? Thank you..","a":"full","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#1297","p":52,"im":[],"fa":"سلام Pucci. ببخشید سؤال احمقانه‌ست… ولی از کِی به بعد یک DBR یا RBD مهم رو دیگه مهم حساب نمی‌کنی؟ یعنی دنبال اینگالف، مصرف شدن یا اسپایک شدنش می‌گردی؟ یا باید یک RBD یا DBR مهم رو همیشه مهم دونست؟ ممنون…","m":1297},{"id":"dbrrbd_p52_1298","t":"Homework on Rally Base Drop and Drop Base Rally.","a":"prosenjitghosh","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1298","p":52,"im":["ebaa30f69b54ad488b188c6f2a768296ada552b7"],"fa":"تکلیف دربارهٔ Rally Base Drop و Drop Base Rally.","ib":{"ebaa30f69b54ad488b188c6f2a768296ada552b7":1},"m":1298},{"id":"dbrrbd_p52_1299","t":"SO.........I completely looked skipped over this homework (not on purpose). Time to backtrack, here is partial HM for CAPS (still working on the others). Doing each TF on every pair\n\n. Any comments are welcome/encouraged. I know i didn't get them all\n\nbut i couldn't figure out a way to show them all without the charts being unreadable.\n\nHopefully im on the right track","a":"Nehru82T","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1299","p":52,"im":["61746e6a6163ce87b03c03db12a8666984abeb56","89de35c0807c4153ac1417ae83b30bdce5067e1d","ac8c5f57281a2fb4aa1a442a6a6ec4fa9d31841c","86ed4f73de121339584d0e179cc68a48ae757b32","2438f6e8b75276e1d3ca802bf2cdd30f124b2789"],"fa":"خب… این تکلیف رو کاملاً از دست دادم و ندیدمش (عمدی نبود). وقت برگشتنه، این بخشی از HM برای CAPS است (بقیه‌شون رو هم دارم کار می‌کنم). هر TF رو روی هر جفت‌ارز انجام می‌دم\n\nهر نظری بدید خوشحال می‌شم. می‌دونم همه‌شون رو نگرفتم\n\nولی راهی پیدا نکردم که همه‌شون رو نشون بدم بدون اینکه چارت‌ها ناخوانا بشن.\n\nامیدوارم مسیر درست رو رفته باشم","ib":{"61746e6a6163ce87b03c03db12a8666984abeb56":4,"89de35c0807c4153ac1417ae83b30bdce5067e1d":4,"ac8c5f57281a2fb4aa1a442a6a6ec4fa9d31841c":4,"86ed4f73de121339584d0e179cc68a48ae757b32":4,"2438f6e8b75276e1d3ca802bf2cdd30f124b2789":4},"m":1299},{"id":"dbrrbd_p52_1300","t":"Gday All\n\nJust a small pic to check I'm doin this correctly...If someone who knows whats what could have a squiz over this for me and lemmie know I'd really appreciate it.\n\nCheers","a":"Gypsy","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#1300","p":52,"im":["e4416214ab513d545f0e91a91da0b9fc36cb37c1"],"fa":"سلام به همه\n\nفقط یک عکس کوچیکه برای اینکه چک کنم درست انجامش می‌دم… اگه یکی که کاره‌ست هست یه نگاهی به این بندازه و بهم بگه، واقعاً ممنون می‌شم.\n\nموفق باشید","ib":{"e4416214ab513d545f0e91a91da0b9fc36cb37c1":2},"m":1300}],"images":[{"k":"a722e5430286f862623b105a2a503004d11758cf","t":"assets/thumbs/a722e5430286f862623b105a2a503004d11758cf.webp","f":"assets/images/a722e5430286f862623b105a2a503004d11758cf.webp","w":1473,"h":793,"b":70824,"o":"a722e5430286f862623b105a2a503004d11758cf.png","p":52,"pid":"dbrrbd_p52_1276"},{"k":"a0078e32b112c17fd5fd2303222cf4d9010d7616","t":"assets/thumbs/a0078e32b112c17fd5fd2303222cf4d9010d7616.webp","f":"assets/images/a0078e32b112c17fd5fd2303222cf4d9010d7616.webp","w":1261,"h":825,"b":48970,"o":"a0078e32b112c17fd5fd2303222cf4d9010d7616.png","p":52,"pid":"dbrrbd_p52_1277"},{"k":"a16354f09480b88821becfb7b40993842f90495d","t":"assets/thumbs/a16354f09480b88821becfb7b40993842f90495d.webp","f":"assets/images/a16354f09480b88821becfb7b40993842f90495d.webp","w":1473,"h":793,"b":97618,"o":"a16354f09480b88821becfb7b40993842f90495d.png","p":52,"pid":"dbrrbd_p52_1278"},{"k":"4a3ed36a019b9147fbc6711d04027